    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/bef1ddafc4971ab4a4cf136e911a850a.poster.avif?t=1755122669\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/bef1ddafc4971ab4a4cf136e911a850a.webm?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/bef1ddafc4971ab4a4cf136e911a850a.mp4?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become an Internet Star in Capybara Hot Tub!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a cute, fluffy streamer and relax in a hot tub while gaining online popularity! Groom your fur, decorate your cozy studio, and turn your capybara into the next viral sensation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/8a49713a1b13ab59fa9f47eea6722791.poster.avif?t=1755122669\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/8a49713a1b13ab59fa9f47eea6722791.webm?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/8a49713a1b13ab59fa9f47eea6722791.mp4?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Total Relaxation in the Hot Tub</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your capybara and keep her happy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/88aca665ab4cb1fa4bd762f374f827f7.poster.avif?t=1755122669\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/88aca665ab4cb1fa4bd762f374f827f7.webm?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/88aca665ab4cb1fa4bd762f374f827f7.mp4?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the bubbles in the tub</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massage her soft fur</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat her to tasty snacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/49685e147b1d3bda59c418021d41e31b.poster.avif?t=1755122669\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/49685e147b1d3bda59c418021d41e31b.webm?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/49685e147b1d3bda59c418021d41e31b.mp4?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capybara \u2013 the Ultimate Internet Star</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t miss your chance to go viral! Stream live from the hot bath and win over your viewers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASMR with juicy berries and tropical drinks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graceful swimming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion outfit showcases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/efb62fdc44310b992a3ddadec254cbd2.poster.avif?t=1755122669\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/efb62fdc44310b992a3ddadec254cbd2.webm?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/efb62fdc44310b992a3ddadec254cbd2.mp4?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capybara\u2019s Home and Studio</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your streaming studio to your liking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock dynamic lighting and bath special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the cutest swim accessories and dress your capybara like a true superstar!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/bef1ddafc4971ab4a4cf136e911a850a.poster.avif?t=1755122669\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/bef1ddafc4971ab4a4cf136e911a850a.webm?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/bef1ddafc4971ab4a4cf136e911a850a.mp4?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become an Internet Star in Capybara Hot Tub!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a cute, fluffy streamer and relax in a hot tub while gaining online popularity! Groom your fur, decorate your cozy studio, and turn your capybara into the next viral sensation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/8a49713a1b13ab59fa9f47eea6722791.poster.avif?t=1755122669\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/8a49713a1b13ab59fa9f47eea6722791.webm?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/8a49713a1b13ab59fa9f47eea6722791.mp4?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Total Relaxation in the Hot Tub</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your capybara and keep her happy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/88aca665ab4cb1fa4bd762f374f827f7.poster.avif?t=1755122669\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/88aca665ab4cb1fa4bd762f374f827f7.webm?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/88aca665ab4cb1fa4bd762f374f827f7.mp4?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the bubbles in the tub</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massage her soft fur</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat her to tasty snacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/49685e147b1d3bda59c418021d41e31b.poster.avif?t=1755122669\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/49685e147b1d3bda59c418021d41e31b.webm?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/49685e147b1d3bda59c418021d41e31b.mp4?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capybara \u2013 the Ultimate Internet Star</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t miss your chance to go viral! Stream live from the hot bath and win over your viewers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASMR with juicy berries and tropical drinks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graceful swimming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion outfit showcases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/efb62fdc44310b992a3ddadec254cbd2.poster.avif?t=1755122669\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/efb62fdc44310b992a3ddadec254cbd2.webm?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/efb62fdc44310b992a3ddadec254cbd2.mp4?t=1755122669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capybara\u2019s Home and Studio</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your streaming studio to your liking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock dynamic lighting and bath special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the cutest swim accessories and dress your capybara like a true superstar!</p></li></ul>",
